        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou therefore, son of man, prophesy, and smite thine hands together, and let the sword be doubled the third time, the sword of the slain: it is the sword of the great men that are slain, which entereth into their privy chambers.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 53
