        "reference": "Ezekiel 21:14",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 21,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "I have set the point of the sword against all their gates, that their heart may faint, and their ruins be multiplied: ah! it is made bright, it is wrapped up for the slaughter.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 64,
